  "body": "I sent:\n\n```\n{\n    \"name\": \"matrix-glib-sdk-test\",\n    \"preset\": \"public\",\n    \"topic\":\"GLib SDK test room\"\n}\n```\n\nI got:\n\n```\n{\n    \"errcode\": \"M_UNKNOWN\",\n    \"error\": \"Internal server error\"\n}\n```\n\nIf I add `\"alias\": \"matrix-glib-sdk-test\"` to the request, I get the correct \"Room alias already taken\" message.\n\nI’m using the latest `pip install`able version as of date (0.12.0).\n",
